  "description": "Free, open-source bioinformatics and cheminformatics studios that run entirely in the web browser: molecular docking with AutoDock Vina, read mapping and variant calling (minimap2, samtools, bcftools in WebAssembly), RNA-seq differential expression, single-cell clustering, microbiome diversity, QSAR, structure analysis, phylogenetics and lab calculators. Files are analysed on the user's computer and every result records its provenance.",
